<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alumax, Alcan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alumax, Alcan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns downgraded Alumax Inc to neutral from attractive and cut Alcan Aluminium Ltd to neutral from buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Alumax ended Monday at 31-1/2 and Alcan at 33-1/2 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
